From: Cody Ho <codyho@stanford.edu>
Subject: [PATCH] Disable m1n1 display bring-up for the M4 Mac mini

Carry the M4 bring-up configuration in the RPM so both stage1 and stage2
skip DCP bring-up and display configuration without modifying the source fork.

Signed-off-by: Cody Ho <codyho@stanford.edu>
Assisted-By: OpenAI Codex (gpt-6-astra, gpt-5.6-sol)
---
diff --git a/config.h b/config.h
--- a/config.h
+++ b/config.h
@@ -13,7 +13,8 @@
 // Minimal build for bring-up
 //#define BRINGUP
 // Disable display configuration / bringup on desktop devices
-//#define NO_DISPLAY
+// Required for M4 Mac mini bring-up; leave the boot framebuffer in place.
+#define NO_DISPLAY
 
 // Print RTKit logs to the console
 //#define RTKIT_SYSLOG
